WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.652
This example builds a simple teaching product code
BTRIM cleans

00:00:05.678 --> 00:00:13.026
the product name SUBSTRING takes the first three
characters UPPER

00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:18.671
standardizes the prefix LPAD pads the numeric ID to

00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:25.952
three digits The double-pipe operator concatenates
the pieces The

00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:30.413
important lesson is that each part of the code comes
from a documented transformation
